  "post_content": "<p>Fanzara&nbsp;ha revivido&nbsp;este fin de semana la Edad Media con una feria, entre otros actos, para conmemorar&nbsp;el 400 aniversario de la repoblaci&oacute;n cristiana del pueblo y la expulsi&oacute;n de los moriscos, que se ha recreado, as&iacute; como la escritura de la repoblaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04350.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04411.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04416.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04419.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04422.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04430.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04437.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04439.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04442.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/masferiamedievalfanzara/dsc04443.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><im